    <mxCell id="wireless-L8" value="Guides (hidden)" style="" parent="0" visible="0" />
    <object id="wireless-dc155" label="&lt;b&gt;Rules&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;· KV-GUEST: client isolation, captive portal, rate limit, DNS filter; lands in GUEST only.&lt;br&gt;· KV-SHOP: shop tools that can't do 802.1X only; key rotated quarterly and whenever a technician who knew it leaves.&lt;br&gt;· No SSID for F&amp;amp;I, card terminals, cameras or the key cabinet: they are wired.&lt;br&gt;· Rogue AP detection on; management VLAN 99 is never broadcast." netdiagrams_guide="1">
